* sg13g2-lc-pll :: sim/divider-elab -- divider SPEED check, ideal-clock control (issues #61, #155). N = 100 (M=12, A=2), nominal corner
* (hbt_typ, mos_tt, cap_typ), 27 C, 3.3 V. Two ideal-clock counter chains (cml2cmos bypassed; bisect control):
*   the same counters + FB flop fed by an ideal 0..3.3 V clock at 625 MHz (5.0 GHz / 8) and 687.5 MHz (5.5 GHz / 8).
* Separate deck from divider_speed: the real chains and these counters get an operating point only in separate decks (issue #153).
.lib @@MODELS_DIR@@/cornerHBT.lib hbt_typ
.lib @@MODELS_DIR@@/cornerMOShv.lib mos_tt
.lib @@MODELS_DIR@@/cornerCAP.lib cap_typ
.lib @@MODELS_DIR@@/cornerRES.lib res_typ
.option temp=27
.include @@DIV_NETLIST@@
VDD vdd 0 3.3
V1 one 0 dc 3.3
VZ zero 0 0
* ideal-clock counters (M = 12: m3 m2 m1 m0 = 1100; A = 4: a2 a1 a0 = 100)
VCK3 ck3 0 pulse(0 3.3 0 80p 80p 720p 1600p)
VCK4 ck4 0 pulse(0 3.3 0 72.7p 72.7p 654.5p 1454.5p)
XM3 ck3 zero zero one one tc3 tcn3 vdd 0 mcounter
XA3 ck3 tc3 tcn3 zero zero one mci3 vdd 0 acounter
XF3 tc3 ck3 fbi3 vdd 0 dff_tg_hv
XM4 ck4 zero zero one one tc4 tcn4 vdd 0 mcounter
XA4 ck4 tc4 tcn4 zero zero one mci4 vdd 0 acounter
XF4 tc4 ck4 fbi4 vdd 0 dff_tg_hv
.save v(ck3) v(mci3) v(fbi3) v(ck4) v(mci4) v(fbi4)
.control
pre_osdi @@OSDI_PSP@@
pre_osdi @@OSDI_PSP_NQS@@
pre_osdi @@OSDI_R3@@
op
tran 20p 150n 0 20p
wrdata @@OUT_DIR@@/speedC.data v(ck3) v(mci3) v(fbi3) v(ck4) v(mci4) v(fbi4)
.endc
.end
